        "q": "I have Indian citizenship but I travel a lot overseas. Can I still apply for Paytm SBI Card SELECT?",
        "a": "Yes, as long as you are a resident of India, you can apply for this credit card. However, it is advisable to contact SBI Card customer service to understand the detailed eligibility criteria for this card."
      },
      {
        "q": "Are all kinds of transactions rewarded with 5% cashback on Paytm SBI Card SELECT?",
        "a": "No, only travel, movie, and Paytm Mall purchases made through the Paytm app are eligible for 5% cashback. Other purchases through the Paytm app are eligible for 2% cashback, while all other non-Paytm spends will earn 1% cashback."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I make utility bill payments via Paytm SBI Card SELECT?",
        "a": "Yes, you can pay your electricity, telephone, mobile, and other utility bills via Paytm and earn 2% value-back on these spends. Besides this, you can also make utility bill payments using the Easy Bill Pay facility."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Paytm SBI Card SELECT offer lounge access benefits?",
        "a": "Yes, Paytm SBI Card SELECT offers 4 complimentary domestic lounge visits per year (maximum 1 per quarter). The card also offers a complimentary Priority Pass Membership worth $99 for the first two years. However, it does not include international lounge visits."
      },
      {
        "q": "How can I apply for Paytm SBI Card SELECT?",
        "a": "You can apply for this credit card online through the Paytm app or the official website of SBI Card. You will need to submit a duly filled application form along with the required documents. Alternatively, you can also apply offline by visiting your nearest SBI branch and submitting the application form in person."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Paytm SBI Card SELECT offer rewards on wallet loads?",
        "a": "No, you cannot earn reward points on certain categories including wallet loads, fuel, rent, and government transactions."
      }
    ]
